>
{% comment %}
  Only two things import recently-viewed-products: the product template, which records the
  visit right below, and predictive-search.js, which now loads on interaction. Preloading it
  everywhere would fetch a module nothing is about to use.
{% endcomment %}
{% if template.name == 'product' %}
